            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1117">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.4.8</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Complex Values</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The OMA DM model prescribes that only leaf nodes have primitive
      values. This model maps very well to remote managers. However, when a
      manager is written in Java and uses the Dmt Admin API to access the
      tree, there are often unnecessary conversions from a complex object, to
      leaf nodes, and back to a complex object. For example, an interior node
      could hold the current GPS position as an OSGi <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Position</fo:inline>
      object, which consists of a longitude, latitude, altitude, speed, and
      direction. All these objects are <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Measurement</fo:inline> objects which
      consist of value, error, and unit. Reading such a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Position</fo:inline>
      object through its leaf nodes only to make a new <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Position</fo:inline>
      object is wasting resources. It is therefore that the Dmt Admin service
      also supports <fo:inline font-style="italic">complex values</fo:inline> as a supplementary
      facility.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If a complex value is used then the leaves must also be accessible
      and represent the same semantics as the complex value. A manager unaware
      of complex values must work correctly by only using the leaf nodes.
      Setting or getting the complex value of an interior node must be
      identical to setting or getting the leaf nodes.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Accessing a complex value requires <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Get</fo:inline> access to the
      node and all its descendants. Setting a complex value requires
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> access to the interior node. Replacing a complex
      value must only generate a single Replace event.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Trying to set or get a complex value on an interior node that does
      not support complex values must throw a Dmt Exception with the code
      <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtException.FEATURE_NOT_SUPPORTED">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">FEATURE_NOT_SUPPORTED</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1142">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.4.9</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Nodes and Types</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The node's type can be set with the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.setNodeType-String-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">setNodeType(String,String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method and acquired with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getNodeType-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getNodeType(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. The namespaces for the types differ for
      interior and leaf nodes. A leaf node is typed with a MIME type and an
      interior node is typed with a DDF Document URI. However, in both cases
      the Dmt Admin service must not verify the syntax of the type
      name.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createLeafNode-String-DmtData-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">createLeafNode(String,DmtData,String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method takes a MIME type as last argument that
      will type the leaf node. The MIME type reflects how the data of the node
      should be <fo:inline font-style="italic">interpreted</fo:inline>. For example, it is possible
      to store a GIF and a JPEG image in a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtData</fo:inline> object with a
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">FORMAT_BINARY</fo:inline> format. Both the GIF and the JPEG object
      share the same <fo:inline font-style="italic">format</fo:inline>, but will have MIME types of
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">image/jpg</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">image/gif</fo:inline> respectively. The Meta
      Node provides a list of possible MIME types.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createInteriorNode-String-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">createInteriorNode(String,String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method takes a DDF Document URI as the last
      argument that will type the interior node. This specification defines
      the DDF Document URIs listed in the following table for interior nodes
      that have a particular meaning in this specification.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d1184e1171">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 117.2</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Standard Interior Node Types</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Interior Node Type</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-header>
                     <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtConstants.DDF_SCAFFOLD">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">DDF_SCAFFOLD</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.maximum="5pt">Scaffold nodes are automatically generated nodes by
              the Dmt Admin service to provide the children node names so that
              Plugins are reachable from the root. See <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="i2931854">
                                       <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                  font-family="inherit"
                                                  letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                  hyphenate="inherit">
                                          <fo:inline font-style="italic">Scaffold Nodes</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2931854"/>
                                       </fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtConstants.DDF_MAP">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">DDF_MAP</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">MAP</fo:inline> nodes define a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">key</fo:inline>
              -&gt; <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">value</fo:inline> mapping construct using the node name
              (key) and the node value (value). See <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="i2837021">
                                       <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                  font-family="inherit"
                                                  letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                  hyphenate="inherit">
                                          <fo:inline font-style="italic">MAP Nodes</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2837021"/>
                                       </fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtConstants.DDF_LIST">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">DDF_LIST</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">LIST</fo:inline> nodes use the node name to
              maintain an index in a list. See <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="i2836847">
                                       <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                  font-family="inherit"
                                                  letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                  hyphenate="inherit">
                                          <fo:inline font-style="italic">LIST Nodes</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2836847"/>
                                       </fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-body>
                  </fo:table>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1211">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.4.10</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Deleting Nodes</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.deleteNode-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">deleteNode(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method on the session represents the Delete
      operation. It deletes the sub-tree of that node. This method is
      applicable to both leaf and interior nodes. Nodes can be deleted by the
      Dmt Admin service in any order. The root node of the session cannot be
      deleted.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, given <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i1647301">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.7</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, deleting node
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P</fo:inline> must delete the nodes <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./P</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./P/
      M</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./P/M/X</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./P/M/n2</fo:inline> and
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./P/M/n3</fo:inline> in any order.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="i1647301">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 117.7</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>DMT node and deletion</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d1184e1236" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/deleting-nodes.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="5.011in"
                                          content-height="1.586in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1240">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.4.11</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Copying Nodes</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.copy-String-String-boolean-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">copy(String,String,boolean)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method on the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtSession</fo:inline> object
      represents the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Copy</fo:inline> operation. A node is completely copied
      to a new URI. It can be specified with a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">boolean</fo:inline> if the
      whole sub-tree (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline>) or just the indicated node is
      copied.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The ACLs must not be copied; the new access rights must be the
      same as if the caller had created the new nodes individually. This
      restriction means that the copied nodes inherit the access rights from
      the parent of the destination node, unless the calling principal does
      not have <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> rights for the parent. See <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i2070130">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Creating Nodes</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2070130"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> for details.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1260">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.4.12</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Renaming Nodes</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.renameNode-String-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">renameNode(String,String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method on the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtSession</fo:inline> object
      represents the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Rename</fo:inline> operation, which replaces the node
      name. It requires permission for the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> operation. The
      root node for the current session can not be renamed.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1272">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.4.13</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Execute</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.execute-String-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">execute(String,String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.execute-String-String-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">execute(String,String,String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> methods can <fo:inline font-style="italic">execute</fo:inline> a node.
      Executing a node is intended to be used when a problem is hard to model
      as a set of leaf nodes. This can be related to synchronization issues or
      data manipulation. The execute methods can provide a correlator for a
      notification and an opaque string that is forwarded to the implementer
      of the node.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Execute operations can not take place in a read only session
      because simultaneous execution could make conflicting changes to the
      tree.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1283">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.4.14</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Closing</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">When all the changes have been made, the session must be closed by
      calling the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.close--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">close()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method on the session. The Dmt Admin service
      must then finalize, clean up, and release any locks. For atomic
      sessions, the Dmt Admin service must automatically commit any changes
      that were made since the last transaction point.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A session times out and is invalidated after an extended period of
      inactivity. The exact length of this period is not specified, but is
      recommended to be at least 1 minute and at most 24 hours. All methods of
      an invalidated session must throw an Dmt Illegal State Exception after
      the session is invalidated.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A session's state is one of the following: <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.STATE_CLOSED">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">STATE_CLOSED</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.STATE_INVALID">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">STATE_INVALID</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> or <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.STATE_OPEN">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">STATE_OPEN</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, as can be queried by the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getState--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getState()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> call. The invalid state is reached either after
      a fatal error case is encountered or after the session is timed out.
      When an atomic session is invalidated, it is automatically rolled back
      to the last transaction point of the session.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="i2538447">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Meta Data</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>117.5</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Meta Data</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getMetaNode-String-">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">getMetaNode(String)</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> method returns a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">MetaNode</fo:inline> object for
    a given URI. This node is called the <fo:inline font-style="italic">meta node</fo:inline>. A
    meta node provides information about nodes.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Any node can optionally have a meta node associated with it. The one
    or more nodes that are described by the meta nodes are called the meta
    node's <fo:inline font-style="italic">related instances</fo:inline>. A meta node can describe a
    singleton-related instance, or it can describe all the children of a given
    parent if it is a <fo:inline font-style="italic">multi-node</fo:inline>. That is to say, meta
    nodes can exist without an actual instance being present. In order to
    retrieve the meta node of a multi-node any name can be used.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, if a new ring tone, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Grieg</fo:inline>, was created in
    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i1465151">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.8</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> it would be possible to get the Meta Node for
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">./Vendor/RingSignals/Grieg</fo:inline> before the node was created. This
    is usually the case for multi nodes. The model is depicted in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i1465151">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.8</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="2em"
                      keep-together.within-column="always"
                      id="i1465151">
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         font-weight="normal"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                         space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                         space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-style="italic"
                         keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block>Figure 117.8</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>Nodes and meta nodes</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d1184e1328" text-align="center">
                  <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/meta-nodes.svg)"
                                       width="auto"
                                       height="auto"
                                       content-width="6.248in"
                                       content-height="1.719in"
                                       text-align="center"/>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">A URI is generally associated with the same Meta Node. The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getMetaNode-String-">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">getMetaNode(String)</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> should return the same meta node for the same URI
    except in the case of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i2931854">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">
                     <fo:inline font-style="italic">Scaffold Nodes</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2931854"/>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>. As the ownership of
    scaffold nodes can change from the Dmt Admin service to the Parent Plugin
    service, or from a Parent Plugin to a Child Plugin, the Meta Node can
    change as well.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The last segment of the URI to get a Meta Node can be any valid node
    name, for example, instead of <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Grieg</fo:inline> it would have been
    possible to retrieve the same Meta Node with the name
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">./Vendor/RingSignals/0</fo:inline>,
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">./Vendor/RingSignals/anyName</fo:inline>,
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">./Vendor/RingSignals/&lt;&gt;</fo:inline>, etc.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The actual meta data can come from two sources:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e1348">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e1349">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Dmt Admin</fo:inline> - Each Dmt Admin service likely
        has a private meta data repository. This meta data is placed in the
        device in a proprietary way.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e1353">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Plugins</fo:inline> - Plugins can carry meta nodes and
        provide these to the Dmt Admin service by implementing the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ReadableDataSession.getMetaNode-String---">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">getMetaNode(String[])</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> method. If a plugin returns a non-null value,
        the Dmt Admin service must use that value, possibly complemented by
        its own metadata for elements not provided by the plugin.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">MetaNode</fo:inline> interface supports methods to retrieve
    read-only meta data. The following sections describes this meta-data in
    more detail.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i2760251">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Operations</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.can-int-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">can(int)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method provide information as to whether the
      associated node can perform the given operation. This information is
      only about the capability; it can still be restricted in runtime by ACLs
      and permissions.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, if the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">can(MetaNode.CMD_EXECUTE)</fo:inline> method
      returns <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline>, the target object supports the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Execute</fo:inline> operation. That is, calling the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.execute-String-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">execute(String,String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method with the target URI is possible.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.can-int-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">can(int)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method can take the following constants as
      parameters:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1383">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1384">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.CMD_ADD">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">CMD_ADD</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1387">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.CMD_DELETE">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">CMD_DELETE</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1390">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.CMD_EXECUTE">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">CMD_EXECUTE</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1393">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.CMD_GET">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">CMD_GET</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1396">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.CMD_REPLACE">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">CMD_REPLACE</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e1400">void foo( DmtSession session, String nodeUri) {
    MetaNode    meta = session.getMetaNode(nodeUri);
  if ( meta !=null &amp;&amp; meta.<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">can(MetaNode.CMD_EXECUTE)</fo:inline> )
        session.execute(nodeUri,"foo" );
}</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i2965501">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Scope</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The scope is part of the meta information of a node. It provides
      information about what the life cycle role is of the node. The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getScope--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getScope()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method on the Meta Node provides this
      information. The value of the scope can be one of the following:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1411">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1412">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.DYNAMIC">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">DYNAMIC</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Dynamic nodes are intended to be created
          and deleted by a management system or an other controlling source.
          This does not imply that it actually is possible to add new nodes
          and delete nodes, the actions can still allow or deny this. However,
          in principle nodes that can be added or deleted have the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.DYNAMIC">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">DYNAMIC</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> scope. The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">LIST</fo:inline> and
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">MAP</fo:inline> nodes, see <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="service.dmt.osgiobjectmodeling">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-style="italic">OSGi Object Modeling</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dmt.osgiobjectmodeling"/>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>, always have <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.DYNAMIC">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">DYNAMIC</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> scope.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1426">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.PERMANENT">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">PERMANENT</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Permanent nodes represent an entity in the
          system. This can be a network interface, a device description, etc.
          Permanent nodes in general map to an object in an object oriented
          language. Despite their name, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.PERMANENT">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">PERMANENT</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> nodes can appear and disappear, for example
          the plugging in of a USB device might create a new <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.PERMANENT">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">PERMANENT</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> node. Generally, the Plugin roots map to
          <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.PERMANENT">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">PERMANENT</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> nodes.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1436">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.AUTOMATIC">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">AUTOMATIC</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Automatic nodes map in general to nodes
          that are closely tied to the parent. They are similar to fields of
          an object in an object oriented language. They cannot be deleted or
          added.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a node representing the Battery can never be deleted
      because it is an intrinsic part of the device; it will therefore be
      <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.PERMANENT">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">PERMANENT</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Level</fo:inline> and number of
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">ChargeCycle</fo:inline> nodes will be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.AUTOMATIC">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">AUTOMATIC</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. A new ring tone is dynamically created by a
      manager and is therefore <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.DYNAMIC">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">DYNAMIC</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1452">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.3</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Description and Default</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1454">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1455">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getDescription--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getDescription()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>) A description of the
          node. Descriptions can be used in dialogs with end users: for
          example, a GUI application that allows the user to set the value of
          a node. Localization of these values is not defined.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1461">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getDefault--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getDefault()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtData</fo:inline>) A default data
          value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1467">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.4</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Validation</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The validation information allows the runtime system to verify
      constraints on the values; it also allows user interfaces to provide
      guidance.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A node does not have to exist in the DMT in order to have meta
      data associated with it. Nodes may exist that have only partial meta
      data, or no metadata, associated with them. For each type of metadata,
      the default value to assume when it is omitted is described in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">MetaNode</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i2955405">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.5</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Data Types</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A leaf node can be constrained to a certain format and one of a
      set of MIME types.</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1477">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1478">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getFormat--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getFormat()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">int</fo:inline>) The required type. This
          type is a logical OR of the supported formats.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1484">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getRawFormatNames--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getRawFormatNames()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Return an array of possible raw format
          names. This is only applicable when the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getFormat--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getFormat()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> returns the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtData.FORMAT_RAW_BINARY">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">FORMAT_RAW_BINARY</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> or <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtData.FORMAT_RAW_STRING">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">FORMAT_RAW_STRING</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> formats. The method must return
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline> otherwise.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1496">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getMimeTypes--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getMimeTypes()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline>) A list of MIME
          types for leaf nodes or DDF types for interior nodes. The Dmt Admin
          service must verify that the actual type of the node is part of this
          set.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i2760429">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Cardinality</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A meta node can constrain the number of
      <fo:inline font-style="italic">siblings</fo:inline> (i.e., not the number of children) of an
      interior or leaf node. This constraint can be used to verify that a node
      must not be deleted, because there should be at least one node left on
      that level ( <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.isZeroOccurrenceAllowed--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">isZeroOccurrenceAllowed()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> ), or to verify that a node cannot be created,
      because there are already too many siblings ( <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getMaxOccurrence--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getMaxOccurrence()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> ).</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If the cardinality of a meta node is more than one, all siblings
      must share the same meta node to prevent an invalid situation. For
      example, if a node has two children that are described by different meta
      nodes, and any of the meta nodes has a cardinality &gt;1, that situation
      is invalid.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./Vendor/RingSignals/&lt;&gt;</fo:inline> meta
      node (where &lt;&gt; stands for any name) could specify that there
      should be between 0 and 12 ring signals.</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1517">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1518">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getMaxOccurrence--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getMaxOccurrence()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">int</fo:inline>) A value greater than 0
          that specifies the maximum number of instances for this node.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1524">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.isZeroOccurrenceAllowed--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">isZeroOccurrenceAllowed()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">boolean</fo:inline>) Returns
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline> if zero instances are allowed. If not, the last
          instance must not be deleted.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1532">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.7</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Matching</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The following methods provide validation capabilities for leaf
      nodes.</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1535">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1536">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.isValidValue-DmtData-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">isValidValue(DmtData)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtData</fo:inline>) Verify that the
          given value is valid for this meta node.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1542">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getValidValues--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getValidValues()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtData[]</fo:inline>) A set of possible
          values for a node, or <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline> otherwise. This can for
          example be used to give a user a set of options to choose
          from.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1550">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.8</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Numeric Ranges</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Numeric leaf nodes (format must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtData.FORMAT_INTEGER">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">FORMAT_INTEGER</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtData.FORMAT_LONG">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">FORMAT_LONG</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, or <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtData.FORMAT_FLOAT">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">FORMAT_FLOAT</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> ) can be checked for a minimum and maximum
      value.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Minimum and maximum values are inclusive. That is, the range is
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">[getMin(),getMax()]</fo:inline>. For example, if the maximum value is 5
      and the minimum value is -5, then the range is [-5,5]. This means that
      valid values are -5,-4,-3,-2... 4, 5.</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1564">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1565">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getMax--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getMax()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">double</fo:inline>) The value of the
          node must be less than or equal to this maximum value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1571">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getMin--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getMin()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">double</fo:inline>) The value of the
          node must be greater than or equal to this minimum value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If no meta data is provided for the minimum and maximum values,
      the meta node must return the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Double.MIN_VALUE</fo:inline>, and
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Double.MAX_VALUE</fo:inline> respectively.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1583">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.9</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Name Validation</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The meta node provides the following name validation facilities
      for both leaf and interior nodes:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1586">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1587">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.isValidName-String-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">isValidName(String)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>) Verifies that the
          given name matches the rules for this meta node.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1593">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getValidNames--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getValidNames()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline>) An array of
          possible names. A valid name for this node must appear in this
          list.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1599">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.5.10</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>User Extensions</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The Meta Node provides an extension mechanism; each meta node can
      be associated with a number of properties. These properties are then
      interpreted in a proprietary way. The following methods are used for
      user extensions:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1602">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1603">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getExtensionPropertyKeys--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getExtensionPropertyKeys()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Returns an array of key names that can be
          provided by this meta node.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1607">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.getExtensionProperty-String-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getExtensionProperty(String)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Returns the value of an extension
          property.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a manufacturer could use a regular expression to
      validate the node names with the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.MetaNode.isValidName-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">isValidName(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method. In a web based user interface it is
      interesting to provide validity checking in the browser, however, in
      such a case the regular expression string is required. This string could
      then be provided as a user extension under the key
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">x-acme-regex-javascript</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d1184e1617">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Plugins</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>117.6</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Plugins</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Plugins take the responsibility of handling DMT operations
    within certain sub-trees of the DMT. It is the responsibility of the Dmt
    Admin service to forward the operation requests to the appropriate plugin.
    The only exceptions are the ACL manipulation commands. ACLs must be
    enforced by the Dmt Admin service and never by the plugin. The model is
    depicted in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i2926111">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.9</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block start-indent="0pt">
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="i2926111">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 117.9</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Device Management Tree example</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d1184e1625" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/plugin-example.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="5.011in"
                                          content-height="2.024in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Plugins are OSGi services. The Dmt Admin service must dynamically
    map and unmap the plugins, acting as node handler, as they are registered
    and unregistered. Service properties are used to specify the sub-tree that
    the plugin can manage as well as mount points that it provides to
    <fo:inline font-style="italic">Child Plugins</fo:inline>; plugins that manage part of the
    Plugin's sub-tree.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a plugin related to Configuration Admin handles the
    sub-tree which stores configuration data. This sub-tree could start at
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">./OSGi/Configuration</fo:inline>. When the client wants to add a new
    configuration object to the DMT, it must issue an <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Add</fo:inline>
    operation to the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">./OSGi/Configuration</fo:inline> node. The Dmt Admin
    service then forwards this operation to the configuration plugin. The
    plugin maps the request to one or more method calls on the Configuration
    Admin service. Such a plugin can be a simple proxy to the Configuration
    Admin service, so it can provide a DMT view of the configuration data
    store.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">There are two types of Dmt plugins: <fo:inline font-style="italic">data
    plugins</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-style="italic">exec plugins</fo:inline>. A data plugin is
    responsible for handling the sub-tree retrieval, addition and deletion
    operations, and handling of meta data, while an exec plugin handles a node
    execution operation.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1646">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Data Sessions</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Data Plugins must participate in the Dmt Admin service sessions. A
      Data Plugin provider must therefore register a Data Plugin service. Such
      a service can create a session for the Dmt Admin service when the given
      sub-tree is accessed by a Dmt Session. If the associated Dmt Session is
      later closed, the Data Session will also be closed. Three types of
      sessions provide different capabilities. Data Plugins do not have to
      implement all session types; if they choose not to implement a session
      type they can return <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1652">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1653">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Readable Data Session</fo:inline> - Must always be
          supported. It provides the basic read-only access to the nodes and
          the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">close()</fo:inline> method. The Dmt Admin service uses this
          session type when the lock mode is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.LOCK_TYPE_SHARED">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">LOCK_TYPE_SHARED</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> for the Dmt Session. Such a session is
          created with the plugin's <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.DataPlugin.openReadOnlySession-String---DmtSession-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">openReadOnlySession(String[],DmtSession)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>, method which returns a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ReadableDataSession">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">ReadableDataSession</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> object.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1665">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Read Write Data Session</fo:inline> - Extends the
          Readable Data Session with capabilities to modify the DMT. This is
          used for Dmt Sessions that are opened with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.LOCK_TYPE_EXCLUSIVE">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">LOCK_TYPE_EXCLUSIVE</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>. Such a session is created with the plugin's
          <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.DataPlugin.openReadWriteSession-String---DmtSession-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">openReadWriteSession(String[],DmtSession)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> method, which returns a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ReadWriteDataSession">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">ReadWriteDataSession</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> object.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1675">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Transactional Data Session</fo:inline> - Extends the
          Read Write Data Session with commit and rollback methods so that
          this session can be used with transactions. It is used when the Dmt
          Session is opened with lock mode <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.LOCK_TYPE_ATOMIC">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">LOCK_TYPE_ATOMIC</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>. Such a session is created with the plugin's
          <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.DataPlugin.openAtomicSession-String---DmtSession-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">openAtomicSession(String[],DmtSession)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> method, which returns a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">TransactionalDataSession</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> object.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1685">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>URIs and Plugins</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The plugin Data Sessions do not use a simple string to identify a
      node as the Dmt Session does. Instead the URI parameter is a
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline>. The members of this <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline> are the
      different segments. The first node after the root is the second segment
      and the node name is the last segment. The different segments require
      escaping of the solidus (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">'/' \u002F</fo:inline>) and reverse solidus
      (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">'\' \u005C</fo:inline>).</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The reason to use <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline> objects instead of the
      original string is to reduce the number times that the URI is parsed.
      The entry String objects, however, are still escaped. For example, the
      URI <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./A/B/image\/jpg</fo:inline> gives the following
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline>:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e1705">{ ".", "A", "B", "image\/jpg" }</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A plugin can assume that the path is validated and can be used
      directly.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1707">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.3</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Associating a sub-tree</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Each plugin is associated with one or more DMT sub-trees. The top
      node of a sub-tree is called the <fo:inline font-style="italic">plugin root</fo:inline>. The
      plugin root is defined by a service registration property. This property
      is different for exec plugins and data plugins:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1713">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1714">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.DataPlugin.DATA_ROOT_URIS">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">DATA_ROOT_URIS</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String+</fo:inline>) A sequence of
          <fo:inline font-style="italic">data URI</fo:inline>, defining a plugin root for data
          plugins.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1722">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ExecPlugin.EXEC_ROOT_URIS">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">EXEC_ROOT_URIS</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String+</fo:inline>) A sequence of
          <fo:inline font-style="italic">exec URI</fo:inline>, defining a plugin root for exec
          plugins.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If the Plugin modifies these service properties then the Dmt Admin
      service must reflect these changes as soon as possible. The reason for
      the different properties is to allow a single service to register both
      as a Data Plugin service as well as an Exec Plugin service.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Data and Exec Plugins live in independent trees and can fully
      overlap. However, an Exec Plugin can only execute a node when the there
      exists a valid node at the corresponding node in the Data tree. That is,
      to be able to execute a node it is necessary that <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.isNodeUri-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">isNodeUri(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> would return <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a data plugin can register itself in its activator to
      handle the sub-tree <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./Dev/Battery</fo:inline>:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e1741">public void start(BundleContext context) {
  Hashtable ht = new Hashtable();
  ht.put(Constants.SERVICE_PID, "com.acme.data.plugin");
  ht.put( DataPlugin.<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DATA_ROOT_URIS</fo:inline>, "./Dev/Battery");
  context.registerService( 
        DataPlugin.class.getName(),
        new BatteryHandler(context);
        ht );
}</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If this activator was executed, an access to
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./Dev/Battery</fo:inline> must be forwarded by the Dmt Admin service to
      this plugin via one of the data session.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1749">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.4</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Synchronization with Dmt Admin Service</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The Dmt Admin service can, in certain cases, detect that a node
      was changed without the plugin knowing about this change. For example,
      if the ACL is changed, the version and timestamp must be updated; these
      properties are maintained by the plugin. In these cases, the Dmt Admin
      service must open a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">ReadableDataSession</fo:inline> and call <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ReadableDataSession.nodeChanged-String---">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">nodeChanged(String[])</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method with the changed URI.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1757">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.5</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Plugin Meta Data</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Plugins can provide meta data; meta data from the Plugin must take
      precedence over the meta data of the Dmt Admin service. If a plugin
      provides meta information, the Dmt Admin service must verify that an
      operation is compatible with the meta data of the given node.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example if the plugin reports in its meta data that the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./A</fo:inline> leaf node can only have the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">text/plain</fo:inline>
      MIME type, the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createLeafNode-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">createLeafNode(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> calls must not be forwarded to the Plugin if the
      third argument specifies any other MIME type. If this contract between
      the Dmt Admin service and the plugin is violated, the plugin should
      throw a Dmt Exception <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtException.METADATA_MISMATCH">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">METADATA_MISMATCH</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i1724768">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Plugins and Transactions</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For the Dmt Admin service to be transactional, transactions must
      be supported by the data plugins. This support is not mandatory in this
      specification, and therefore the Dmt Admin service has no transactional
      guarantees for atomicity, consistency, isolation or durability. The
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtAdmin</fo:inline> interface and the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DataPlugin</fo:inline> (or more
      specifically the data session) interfaces, however, are designed to
      support Data Plugin services that are transactional. Exec plugins need
      not be transaction-aware because the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">execute</fo:inline> method does
      not provide transactional semantics, although it can be executed in an
      atomic transaction.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Data Plugins do not have to support atomic sessions. When the Dmt
      Admin service creates a Transactional Data Session by calling <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.DataPlugin.openAtomicSession-String---DmtSession-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">openAtomicSession(String[],DmtSession)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> the Data Plugin is allowed to return
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline>. In that case, the plugin does not support atomic
      sessions. The caller receives a Dmt Exception.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Plugins must persist any changes immediately for Read Write Data
      Sessions. Transactional Data Sessions must delay changes until the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.commit--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">commit()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method is called, which can happen multiple
      times during a session. The opening of an atomic session and the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.commit--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">commit()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.rollback--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">rollback()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> methods all establish a <fo:inline font-style="italic">transaction
      point</fo:inline>. Rollback can never go further back than the last
      transaction point.</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1797">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1798">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.commit--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">commit()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Commit any changes that were made to the
          DMT but not yet persisted. This method should not throw an Exception
          because other Plugins already could have persisted their data and
          can no longer roll it back. The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">commit</fo:inline> method can be
          called multiple times in an open session, and if so, the commit must
          make persistent the changes since the last transaction point.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1804">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.rollback--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">rollback()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Undo any changes made to the sub-tree
          since the last transaction point.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1808">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ReadableDataSession.close--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">close()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - Clean up and release any locks. The Dmt
          Admin service must call the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">commit</fo:inline> methods before the
          close method is called. A Plugin must not perform any persistency
          operations in the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">close</fo:inline> method.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.commit--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">commit()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.rollback--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">rollback()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ReadableDataSession.close--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">close()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> plugin data session methods must all be called
      in reverse order of that in which Plugins joined the session.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If a Plugin throws a fatal exception during an operation, the Dmt
      Session must be rolled back immediately, automatically rolling back all
      data plugins, as well as the plugins that threw the fatal Dmt Exception.
      The fatality of an Exception can be checked with the Dmt Exception <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtException.isFatal--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">isFatal()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If a plugin throws a non-fatal exception in any method accessing
      the DMT, the current operation fails, but the session remains open for
      further commands. All errors due to invalid parameters (e.g.
      non-existing nodes, unrecognized values), all temporary errors, etc.
      should fall into this category.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A rollback of the transaction can take place due to any
      irregularity during the session. For example:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e1830">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1831">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>A necessary Plugin is unregistered or unmapped</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1833">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>A fatal exception is thrown while calling a plugin</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1835">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Critical data is not available</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e1837">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>An attempt is made to breach the security</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Any Exception thrown during the course of a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.commit--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">commit()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> or <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.TransactionalDataSession.rollback--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">rollback()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method call is considered fatal, because the
      session can be in a half-committed state and is not safe for further
      use. The operation in progress should be continued with the remaining
      Plugins to achieve a <fo:inline font-style="italic">best-effort</fo:inline> solution in this
      limited transactional model. Once all plugins have been committed or
      rolled back, the Dmt Admin service must throw an exception, specifying
      the cause exception(s) thrown by the plugin(s), and should log an
      error.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1847">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.7</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Side Effects</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Changing a node's value will have a side effect of changing the
      system. A plugin can also, however, cause state changes with a get
      operation. Sometimes the pattern to use a get operation to perform a
      state changing action can be quite convenient. The get operation,
      however, is defined to have no side effects. This definition is
      reflected in the session model, which allows the DMT to be shared among
      readers. Therefore, plugins should refrain from causing side effects for
      read-only operations.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e1850">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.8</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Copying</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Plugins do not have to support the copy operation. They can throw
      a Dmt Exception with a code <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">FEATURE_NOT_SUPPORTED</fo:inline>. In this
      case, the Dmt Admin service must do the copying node by node. For the
      clients of the Dmt Admin service, it therefore appears that the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">copy</fo:inline> method is always supported.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i2931854">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.6.9</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Scaffold Nodes</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">As Plugins can be mapped anywhere into the DMT it is possible that
      a part of the URI has no corresponding Plugin, such a plugin would not
      be <fo:inline font-style="italic">reachable</fo:inline> unless the intermediate nodes were
      provided. A program that would try to discover the DMT would not be able
      to find the registered Plugins as the intermediate nodes would not be
      discoverable.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">These intermediate nodes that will make all plugins reachable must
      therefore be provided by the Dmt Admin service, they are called the
      <fo:inline font-style="italic">scaffold nodes</fo:inline>. The only purpose of the scaffold
      nodes is to allow every node to be discovered when the DMT is traversed
      from the root down. Scaffold nodes are provided both for Data Plugins as
      well as Exec Plugins as well as for Child Plugins that are mounted
      inside a Parent Plugin, see <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i2538366">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Sharing the DMT</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2538366"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. In <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i2931861">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.10</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> node is a scaffold node
      because there is no plugin associated with it. The Dmt Admin service
      must, however, provide the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Battery</fo:inline> node as child node of
      the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> node.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="i2931861">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 117.10</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Scaffold Nodes</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d1184e1881" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/scaffold-nodes.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="6.274in"
                                          content-height="1.681in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A scaffold node is always an interior node and has limited
      functionality, it must have a type of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtConstants.DDF_SCAFFOLD">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">DDF_SCAFFOLD</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. It has no value, it is impossible to add or
      delete nodes to it, and the methods that are allowed for a scaffold node
      are specified in the following table.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d1184e1888">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 117.3</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Supported Scaffold Node Methods</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Method</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-header>
                     <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                           space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
