               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A URI can cross multiple mount points, shared and unshared. For
      example, if a network interface could be associated with a number of
      firewall rules then it is possible to register a URI on the designated
      network interface that refers to the Firewall rules. For the previous
      example, a Plugin could register a Firewall if the following
      registrations were done:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e2406">Root URI                    Mount Points    Plugin  Parent  Name    
./Gateway                   [Interface/#]   Gw              
./Gateway/Interface/#       [Fw/#]          WAN If. Gw      11
./Gateway/Interface/#       []              LAN If. Gw      33
./Gateway/Interface/#       []              VPN.1   Gw      42
./Gateway/Interface/11/Fw/# []              Fw.1    WAN If. 97</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">This example DMT is depicted in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i2673550">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.16</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="i2673550">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 117.16</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Mount Point Multiple Sharing</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d1184e2413" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/mount-point-multiple-sharing.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="5.011in"
                                          content-height="2.458in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e2416">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.7.4</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Mount Points are Excluded</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Mount nodes are logically not included in the sub-tree of a
      Plugin. The Dmt Admin service must never ask any information from/about
      a Mount Point node to its Parent Plugin. A Parent Plugin must also not
      return the name of a mount point in the list of child node names, the
      Mount Point and its subtree is logically excluded from the sub-tree. For
      the Dmt Admin service an unoccupied mount point is a node that does not
      exist. Its name, must only be discoverable if a Plugin has actually
      mounted the node. The Dmt Admin service must ensure that the names of
      the mounted Plugins are included for that level.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">In the case of shared mount points the Dmt Admin service must
      provide the children names of all registered Child Plugins that share
      that node level.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a Plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P1</fo:inline> registered with the plugin
      root of <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./A/B</fo:inline>, having two leaf nodes <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">E</fo:inline>, and a
      mount point <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">C</fo:inline> must not return the name <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">C</fo:inline> when
      the child node names for node <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">B</fo:inline> are requested. This is
      depicted in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i2488828">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.17</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. The Dmt Admin service must
      ensure that <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">C</fo:inline> is returned in the list of names when a
      Plugin is mounted on that node.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="i2488828">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 117.17</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Example Exclusion</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d1184e2441" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/exclusion-example.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="6.297in"
                                          content-height="1.693in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i2498904">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.7.5</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Mapping a Plugin</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A Plugin is not stand alone, its validity can depend on other
      Plugins. Invalid states make it possible that a Plugin is either
      <fo:inline font-style="italic">mapped</fo:inline> or <fo:inline font-style="italic">unmapped</fo:inline>. When a
      Plugin is mapped it is available in the DMT and when it is unmapped it
      is not available. Any registration, unregistration, or modification of
      its services properties of a Plugin can potentially alter the mapped
      state of any related Plugin. A plugin becomes
      <fo:inline font-style="italic">eligible</fo:inline> for mapping when it is registered.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A plugin can have multiple roots. However, the mapping is
      described as if there is a single plugin root. Plugins with multiple
      roots must be treated as multiple plugins that can each independently be
      mapped or unmapped depending on the context.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If no Parent Plugin is available, the Dmt Admin service must act
      as a virtual Parent Plugin that allows mount points anywhere in the tree
      where there is no mapped plugin yet.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">When a Plugin becomes eligible then the following assertions must
      be valid for that Plugin to become mapped:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e2457">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2458">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>If it has one or more mount points then</fo:block>
                           <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                          provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                          id="d1184e2460">
                              <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                            space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                            space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                            id="d1184e2461">
                                 <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                    <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-label>
                                 <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                    <fo:block>
                                       <fo:block>It must have at most one Data and/or Exec Root URI.</fo:block>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-body>
                              </fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                            space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                            space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                            id="d1184e2463">
                                 <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                    <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-label>
                                 <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                    <fo:block>
                                       <fo:block>None of its mount points must overlap.</fo:block>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-body>
                              </fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                            space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                            space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                            id="d1184e2465">
                                 <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                    <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-label>
                                 <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                    <fo:block>
                                       <fo:block>Any already mapped Child Plugins must be compatible with
              its mount points.</fo:block>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-body>
                              </fo:list-item>
                           </fo:list-block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2467">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>If no mount points are specified then there must be no Child
          Plugins already registered.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2469">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>The plugin root must be compatible with the corresponding
          parent's mount point. When a Parent Plugin is available, the plugin
          root must match exactly to the absolute URI of the parent's mount
          point.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2471">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>The plugin root must be compatible with any other plugins on
          that mount point.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If either of these assertions fail then the Dmt Admin service must
      log an error and ignore the registered Plugin, it must not become
      mapped. If, through the unregistration or modification of the service
      properties, the assertions can become valid then the Dmt Admin service
      must retry mapping the Plugin so that it can become available in the
      DMT. Any mappings and unmappings that affect nodes that are in the
      sub-tree of an active session must abort that session with a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtException.CONCURRENT_ACCESS">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">CONCURRENT_ACCESS</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> exception.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">When there are errors in the configuration then the ordering will
      define which plugins are mapped or not. Since this is an error situation
      no ordering is defined between conflicting plugins.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a number of Plugins are registered in the given
      order:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e2479">Plugin Root     Children    Mount Points    Plugin
./A/B           E           C               P1
./A/B/C                                     P2
./A/B/D                                     P3</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The first Plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P1</fo:inline> will be registered immediately
      without problems. It has only a single plugin root as required by the
      fact that it is a Parent Plugin (it has a mount point). There are no
      Child Plugins yet so it is impossible to have a violation of the mount
      points. As there is no Parent Plugin registered, the Dmt Admin service
      will map plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P1</fo:inline> and automatically provide the scaffold
      node <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">A</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">When Plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P2</fo:inline> is registered its plugin root maps to
      a mount point in Plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P1</fo:inline>. As <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P2</fo:inline> is not a
      Parent Plugin it is only necessary that it has no Child Plugins. As it
      has no Child Plugins, the mapping will succeed.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P3</fo:inline> cannot be mapped because the Parent Plugin
      is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P1</fo:inline> but <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P1</fo:inline> does not provide a mount point
      for <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P3</fo:inline>'s plugin root <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">./A/B/D</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If, at a later time P1 is unregistered then the Dmt Admin service
      must map plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P3</fo:inline> and leave plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P2</fo:inline> mapped.
      This sequence of action is depicted in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i2743587">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.18</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If plugin <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P1</fo:inline> becomes registered again at a later time
      it can then in its turn not be mapped as there would be a child plugin
      (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">P3</fo:inline>) that would not map to its mount point.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="i2743587">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 117.18</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Plugin Activation</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d1184e2525" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/plugin-activation.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="6.297in"
                                          content-height="2.246in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="i2743673">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.7.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Mount Plugins</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">In <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="i2498904">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Mapping a Plugin</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2498904"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> it is specified that a Plugin can be
      <fo:inline font-style="italic">mapped</fo:inline> or not. The mapped state of a Plugin can
      change depending on other plugins that are registered and unregistered.
      Plugins require in certain cases to know:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e2536">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2537">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>What is the name of their root node if they mount on a shared
          mount point.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2539">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>What is the mapping state of the Plugin.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">To find out these details a Plugin can implement the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPlugin">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">MountPlugin</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
      interface; this is a mixin interface, it is not necessary to register it
      as <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPlugin">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">MountPlugin</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service. The Dmt Admin service must do an
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">instanceof</fo:inline> operation on Data Plugin services and Exec
      Plugin services to detect if they are interested in the mount point
      information.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The Mount Point interface is used by the Dmt Admin service to
      notify the Plugin when it becomes mapped and when it becomes unmapped.
      The Plugin will be informed about each plugin root separately.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The Mount Plugin specifies the following methods that are called
      synchronously:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e2551">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2552">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPlugin.mountPointAdded-MountPoint-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">mountPointAdded(MountPoint)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - The Dmt Admin service must call this
          method after it has mapped a plugin root. From this point on the
          given mount point provides the actual path until the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPlugin.mountPointRemoved-MountPoint-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">mountPointRemoved(MountPoint)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> is called with an equal object. The given
          Mount Point can be used to post events.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2558">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPlugin.mountPointRemoved-MountPoint-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">mountPointRemoved(MountPoint)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - The Dmt Admin service must call this
          method after it has unmapped the given mount point. This method must
          always be called when a plugin root is unmapped, even if this is
          caused by the unregistration of the plugin.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">As the mapping and unmapping of a plugin root can happen any
      moment in time a Plugin that implements the Mount Plugin interface must
      be prepared to handle these events at any time on any thread.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPoint">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">MountPoint</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> interface has two separate
      responsibilities:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e2567">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2568">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Path</fo:inline> - The path that this Mount Point is
          associated with. This path is a plugin root of the plugin. This path
          is identical to the Plugin's root except when it is mounted on a
          shared mount point; in that case the URI ends in the name chosen by
          the Dmt Admin service. The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPoint.getMountPath--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getMountPath()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> method provides the path.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2574">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Events</fo:inline> - Post events about the given
          sub-tree that signal internal changes that occur outside a Dmt
          Session. The Dmt Admin service must treat these events as they were
          originated from modifications to the DMT. That is, they need to be
          forwarded to the Event Admin as well as the Dmt Listeners. For this
          purpose there are the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPoint.postEvent-String-String---Dictionary-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">postEvent(String,String[],Dictionary)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPoint.postEvent-String-String---String---Dictionary-">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">postEvent(String,String[],String[],Dictionary)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> methods.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a Data Plugin monitoring one of the batteries
      registers with the following service properties:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e2584">dataRootURIs                "./Device/Battery/#"</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> node is from a Parent Plugin that provided
      the shared mount point. The Battery Plugin implements the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPlugin">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">MountPlugin</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
      interface so it gets called back when it is mapped. This will cause the
      Dmt Admin service to call the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPlugin.mountPointAdded-MountPoint-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">mountPointAdded(MountPoint)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method on the plugin. In this case, it will get
      just one mount point, the mount point for its plugin root. If the Dmt
      Admin service would have assigned the Battery Plugin number 101 then the
      <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPoint.getMountPath--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getMountPath()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> would return:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e2595">[ ".", "Device", "Battery", "101" ]</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">As the Plugin monitors the charge state of the battery it can
      detect a significant change. In that case it must send an event to
      notify any observers. The following code shows how this could be
      done:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d1184e2597">@Component( properties="dataRootURIs=./Device/Battery/#",
                provide=DataPlugin.class)
public class Battery implements DataPlugin, MountPlugin {
    Timer          timer;
    volatile float charge;
    TimerTask      task;

    public void mountPointsAdded(final MountPoint[] mountPoints){
        task = new TimerTask() {
            public void run() {
                float next = measure();
                if (Math.abs(charge - next) &gt; 0.2) {
                    charge = next;
                    mountPoints[0].postEvent(DmtConstants.EVENT_TOPIC_REPLACED,
                        new String[] { "Charge" }, null);
                }
            }
        };
        timer.schedule(task, 1000);
    }

    public void mountPointsRemoved(MountPoint[] mountPoints){
            task.cancel();
            task = null;
    }
    ... // Other methods
}</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d1184e2598">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Access Control Lists</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>117.8</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Access Control Lists</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Each node in the DMT can be protected with an <fo:inline font-style="italic">access
    control list</fo:inline>, or <fo:inline font-style="italic">ACL</fo:inline>. An ACL is a list of
    associations between <fo:inline font-style="italic">Principal</fo:inline> and
    <fo:inline font-style="italic">Operation</fo:inline>:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2610">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2611">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Principal</fo:inline> - The identity that is authorized
        to use the associated operations. Special principal is the wildcard
        (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">'*' \u002A</fo:inline>); the operations granted to this principal
        are called the <fo:inline font-style="italic">global permissions</fo:inline>. The global
        permissions are available to all principals.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2619">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Operation</fo:inline> - A list of operations:
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">ADD, DELETE, GET, REPLACE, EXECUTE</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">DMT ACLs are defined as strings with an internal syntax in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i2165260">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">[1] <fo:inline font-style="italic">OMA DM-TND v1.2 draft</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>. Instances of the ACL class can be created by
    supplying a valid OMA DM ACL string as its parameter. The syntax of the
    ACL is presented here in shortened form for convenience:</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d1184e2629">acl         ::= ( acl-entry ( '&amp;' acl-entry)* )
acl-entry   ::= command '=' ( principals | '*' )
principals  ::= principal ( '+' principal )*
principal   ::= ~['=' '&amp;' '*' '+' '\t' '\n' '\r']+</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The principal name should only use printable characters according to
    the OMA DM specification.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d1184e2631">command     ::= 'Add' | 'Delete' | 'Exec'| 'Get' | 'Replace'</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">White space between tokens is not allowed.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Examples:</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d1184e2634">Add=*&amp;Replace=*&amp;Get=*

Add=www.sonera.fi-8765&amp;Delete=www.sonera.fi-8765&amp; «
Replace=www.sonera.fi-8765+321_ibm.com&amp;Get=*</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.Acl-String-">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Acl(String)</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> constructor can be used to construct an ACL from
    an ACL string. The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.toString--">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">toString()</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> method returns a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline> object that
    is formatted in the specified form, also called the canonical form. In
    this form, the principals must be sorted alphabetically and the order of
    the commands is:</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d1184e2644"> ADD,   DELETE,   EXEC,   GET,   REPLACE</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> class is immutable, meaning that a
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> object can be treated like a string, and that the object
    cannot be changed after it has been created.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">ACLs must only be verified by the Dmt Admin service when the session
    has an associated principal.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">ACLs are properties of nodes. If an ACL is <fo:inline font-style="italic">not set
    </fo:inline>(i.e. contains no commands nor principals), the
    <fo:inline font-style="italic">effective</fo:inline> ACL of that node must be the ACL of its
    first ancestor that has a non-empty ACL. This effective ACL can be
    acquired with the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getEffectiveNodeAcl-String-">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">getEffectiveNodeAcl(String)</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> method. The root node of DMT must always have an
    ACL associated with it. If this ACL is not explicitly set, it should be
    set to <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Add=*&amp;Get=*&amp;Replace=*</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">This effect is shown in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i1547055">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.19</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>. This diagram
    shows the ACLs set on a node and their effect (which is shown by the
    shaded rectangles). Any principal can get the value of <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">p</fo:inline>,
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">q</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">r</fo:inline>, but they cannot replace, add or delete
    the node. Node <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">t</fo:inline> can only be read and replaced by principal
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">S1</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Node <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">X</fo:inline> is fully accessible to any authenticated
    principal because the root node specifies that all principals have
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Get</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Add</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> access
    (*-&gt;G,A,R).</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="2em"
                      keep-together.within-column="always"
                      id="i1547055">
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         font-weight="normal"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                         space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                         space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-style="italic"
                         keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block>Figure 117.19</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>ACL inheritance</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d1184e2689" text-align="center">
                  <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/acl-inheritance.svg)"
                                       width="auto"
                                       height="auto"
                                       content-width="5.011in"
                                       content-height="2.471in"
                                       text-align="center"/>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The definition and example demonstrate the access rights to the
    properties of a node, which includes the value.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Changing the ACL property itself has different rules. If a principal
    has <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> access to an interior node, the principal is
    permitted to change its own ACL property <fo:inline font-style="italic">and</fo:inline> the ACL
    properties of all its child nodes. <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> access on a leaf
    node does not allow changing the ACL property itself.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">In the previous example, only principal S1 is authorized to change
    the ACL of node B because it has <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> permission on node
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">B</fo:inline>'s parent node <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">A</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="2em"
                      keep-together.within-column="always"
                      id="i1551391">
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         font-weight="normal"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                         space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                         space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-style="italic"
                         keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block>Figure 117.20</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>ACLs for the ACL property</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d1184e2711" text-align="center">
                  <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dmt/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dmt/src/main/resources/spec/acls-for-acl-property.svg)"
                                       width="auto"
                                       height="auto"
                                       content-width="5.011in"
                                       content-height="1.529in"
                                       text-align="center"/>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i1551391">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">Figure 117.20</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> demonstrates the effect of this rule with
    an example. Server S1 can change the ACL properties of all interior nodes.
    A more detailed analysis:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2718">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2719">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Root</fo:inline> - The root allows all authenticated
        principals to access it. The root is an interior node so the
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> permission permits the change of the ACL
        property.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2725">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Node A</fo:inline> - Server S1 has <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline>
        permission and node A is an interior node so principal S1 can modify
        the ACL.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2731">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Node B</fo:inline> - Server S1 has no
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> permission for node B, but the parent node A of
        node B grants principal S1 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> permission, and S1 is
        therefore permitted to change the ACL.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2739">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Node t</fo:inline> - Server <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">S1</fo:inline> must not be
        allowed to change the ACL of node <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">t</fo:inline>, despite the fact
        that it has <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> permission on node <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">t</fo:inline>.
        For leaf nodes, permission to change an ACL is defined by the
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Replace</fo:inline> permission in the parent node's ACL. This parent,
        node B, has no such permission set and thus, access is denied.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The following methods provide access to the ACL property of the
    node.</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2754">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2755">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getNodeAcl-String-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">getNodeAcl(String)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Return the ACL for the given node, this
        method must not take any ACL inheritance into account. The ACL may be
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline> if no ACL is set.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2761">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getEffectiveNodeAcl-String-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">getEffectiveNodeAcl(String)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Return the effective ACL for the given node,
        taking any inheritance into account.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2765">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.setNodeAcl-String-Acl-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">setNodeAcl(String,Acl)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Set the node's ACL. The ACL can be
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline>, in which case the effective permission must be
        derived from an ancestor. The Dmt Admin service must call <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.ReadableDataSession.nodeChanged-String---">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">nodeChanged(String[])</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> on the data session with the given plugin to
        let the plugin update any timestamps and versions.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> class maintains the permissions for a given
    principal in a bit mask. The following permission masks are defined as
    constants in the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> class:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2779">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2780">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.ADD">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">ADD</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2783">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.DELETE">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">DELETE</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2786">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.EXEC">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">EXEC</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2789">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.GET">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">GET</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2792">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.REPLACE">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">REPLACE</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The class features methods for getting permissions for given
    principals. A number of methods allow an existing ACL to be modified while
    creating a new ACL.</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2796">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2797">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.addPermission-String-int-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">addPermission(String,int)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Return a new <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> object where
        the given permissions have been added to permissions of the given
        principal.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2803">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.deletePermission-String-int-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">deletePermission(String,int)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Return a new <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> object where
        the given permissions have been removed from the permissions of the
        given principal.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2809">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.setPermission-String-int-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">setPermission(String,int)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Return a new <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> object where
        the permissions of the given principal are overwritten with the given
        permissions.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Information from a given ACL can be retrieved with:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2816">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2817">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.getPermissions-String-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">getPermissions(String)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">int</fo:inline>) Return the combined
        permission mask for this principal.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2823">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.getPrincipals--">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">getPrincipals()</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline>) Return a list of
        principals (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline> objects) that have been granted
        permissions for this node.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Additionally, the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.Acl.isPermitted-String-int-">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">isPermitted(String,int)</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> method verifies if the given ACL authorizes the
    given permission mask. The method returns <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline> if all
    commands in the mask are allowed by the ACL.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">For example:</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d1184e2839">    Acl acl = new Acl("Get=S1&amp;Replace=S1");

    if ( acl.isPermitted("S1", Acl.GET+Acl.REPLACE ))
        ... // will execute

    if ( acl.isPermitted(
        "S1", Acl.GET+Acl.REPLACE+Acl.ADD ))
        ... // will NOT execute</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e2840">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.8.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Global Permissions</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Global permissions are indicated with the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">'*'</fo:inline> and the
      given permissions apply to all principals. Processing the global
      permissions, however, has a number of non-obvious side effects:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e2846">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2847">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Global permissions can be retrieved and manipulated using the
          special '*' principal: all methods of the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">Acl</fo:inline> class
          that have a principal parameter also accept this principal.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2852">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Global permissions are automatically granted to all specific
          principals. That is, the result of the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">getPermissions</fo:inline>
          or <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">isPermitted</fo:inline> methods will be based on the OR of the
          global permissions and the principal-specific permissions.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2859">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>If a global permission is revoked, it is revoked from all
          specific principals, even if the specific principals already had
          that permission before it was made global.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2861">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>None of the global permissions can be revoked from a specific
          principal. The OMA DM ACL format does not handle exceptions, which
          must be enforced by the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">deletePermission</fo:inline> and
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">setPermission</fo:inline> methods.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e2868">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.8.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Ghost ACLs</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The ACLs are fully maintained by the Dmt Admin service and
      enforced when the session has an associated principal. A plugin must be
      completely unaware of any ACLs. The Dmt Admin service must synchronize
      the ACLs with any change in the DMT that is made through its service
      interface. For example, if a node is deleted through the Dmt Admin
      service, it must also delete an associated ACL.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The DMT nodes, however, are mapped to plugins, and plugins can
      delete nodes outside the scope of the Dmt Admin service.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">As an example, consider a configuration record which is mapped to
      a DMT node that has an ACL. If the configuration record is deleted using
      the Configuration Admin service, the data disappears, but the ACL entry
      in the Dmt Admin service remains. If the configuration dictionary is
      recreated with the same PID, it will get the old ACL, which is likely
      not the intended behavior.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">This specification does not specify a solution to solve this
      problem. Suggestions to solve this problem are:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e2874">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2875">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Use a proprietary callback mechanism from the underlying
          representation to notify the Dmt Admin service to clean up the
          related ACLs.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e2877">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Implement the services on top of the DMT. For example, the
          Configuration Admin service could use a plugin that provides general
          data storage service.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="i2753759">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Notifications</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>117.9</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Notifications</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">In certain cases it is necessary for some code on the device to
    alert a remote management server or to initiate a session; this process is
    called sending a notification or an <fo:inline font-style="italic">alert</fo:inline>. Some
    examples:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2885">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2886">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>A Plugin that must send the result of an asynchronous
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">EXEC</fo:inline> operation.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2891">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>Sending a request to the server to start a management
        session.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2893">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>Notifying the server of completion of a software update
        operation.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Notifications can be sent to a management server using the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.NotificationService.sendNotification-String-int-String-AlertItem---">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">sendNotification(String,int,String,AlertItem[])</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> method on the Notification Service. This method is
    on the Notification Service and not on the session, because the session
    can already be closed when the need for an alert arises. If an alert is
    related to a session, the session can provide the required principal, even
    after it is closed.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The remote server is alerted with one or more <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.AlertItem">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">AlertItem</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> objects. The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">AlertItem</fo:inline> class
    describes details of the alert. An alert code is an alert type identifier,
    usually requiring specifically formatted <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">AlertItem</fo:inline>
    objects.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The data syntax and semantics vary widely between various alerts,
    and so does the optionality of particular parameters of an alert item. If
    an item, such as source or type, is not defined, the corresponding getter
    method must return <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.AlertItem">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">AlertItem</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> class contains the following items. The value of
    these items must be defined in an alert definition:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2915">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2916">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">source</fo:inline> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>) The URI of a node
        that is related to this request. This parameter can be
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2924">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">type</fo:inline> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>) The type of the item.
        For example, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">x-oma-application:syncml.samplealert</fo:inline> in the
        Generic Alert example.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2932">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">mark</fo:inline> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>) Mark field of an
        alert. Contents depend on the alert type.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2938">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">data</fo:inline> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtData</fo:inline>) The payload of the
        alert with its type.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">An <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.AlertItem">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">AlertItem</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> object can be constructed with two different
    constructors:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2948">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2949">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.AlertItem.AlertItem-String-String-String-DmtData-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">AlertItem(String,String,String,DmtData)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - This method takes all the previously defined
        fields.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2953">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.AlertItem.AlertItem-String---String-String-DmtData-">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">AlertItem(String[],String,String,DmtData)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Same as previous but with a convenience
        parameter for a segmented URI.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Notification Service provides the following method to send <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.AlertItem">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">AlertItem</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> objects to the management server:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e2962">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e2963">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.NotificationService.sendNotification-String-int-String-AlertItem---">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">sendNotification(String,int,String,AlertItem[])</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> - Send the alert to the server that is
        associated with the session. The first argument is the name of the
        principal (identifying the remote management system) or
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline> for implementation defined routing. The
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">int</fo:inline> argument is the <fo:inline font-style="italic">alert type</fo:inline>. The
        alert types are defined by <fo:inline font-style="italic">managed object types</fo:inline>.
        The third argument (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>) can be used for the
        correlation id of a previous execute operation that triggered the
        alert. The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">AlertItem</fo:inline> objects contain the data of the
        alert. The method will run asynchronously from the caller. The
        Notification Service must provide a reliable delivery method for these
        alerts. Alerts must therefore not be re-transmitted.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">When this method is called with <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline> correlator,
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">null</fo:inline> or empty <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">AlertItem</fo:inline> array, and a 0 code
        as values, it should send a protocol specific notification that must
        initiate a new management session.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Implementers should base the routing on the session or server
    information provided as a parameter in the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.notification.NotificationService.sendNotification-String-int-String-AlertItem---">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">sendNotification(String,int,String,AlertItem[])</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> method. Routing might even be possible without any
    routing information if there is a well known remote server for the
    device.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">If the request cannot be routed, the Alert Sender service must
    immediately throw a Dmt Exception with a code of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtException.ALERT_NOT_ROUTED">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">ALERT_NOT_ROUTED</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>. The caller should not attempt to retry the
    sending of the notification. It is the responsibility of the Notification
    Service to deliver the notification to the remote management
    system.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e2996">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.9.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Routing Alerts</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The Notification Service allows external parties to route alerts
      to their destination. This mechanism enables Protocol Adapters to
      receive any alerts for systems with which they can communicate.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Such a Protocol Adapter should register a Remote Alert Sender
      service. It should provide the following service property:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e3000">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e3001">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">principals</fo:inline> - (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String+</fo:inline>) The
          array of principals to which this Remote Alert Sender service can
          route alerts. If this property is not registered, the Remote Alert
          Sender service will be treated as the default sender. The default
          alert sender is only used when a more specific alert sender cannot
          be found.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If multiple Remote Alert Sender services register for the same
      principals highest ranking service is taken as defined in the OSGi
      Core.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d1184e3009">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Exceptions</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>117.10</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Exceptions</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Most of the methods of this Dmt Admin service API throw Dmt
    Exceptions whenever an operation fails. The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>
    class contains numeric error codes which describe the cause of the error.
    Some of the error codes correspond to the codes described by the OMA DM
    spec, while some are introduced by the OSGi Working Group. The documentation of
    each method describes what codes could potentially be used for that
    method.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The fatality of the exception decides if a thrown Exception rolls
    back an atomic session or not. If the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtException.isFatal--">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">isFatal()</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> method returns <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline>, the Exception is
    fatal and the session must be rolled back.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">All possible error codes are constants in the
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline> class.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d1184e3025">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Events</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>117.11</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Events</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">There are the following mechanisms to work with events when using
    the Dmt Admin service.</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d1184e3028">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e3029">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Event Admin service</fo:inline> - Standard asynchronous
        notifications</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d1184e3033">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Dmt Event Listener service</fo:inline> - A white board
        model for listener. A registered <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                          internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEventListener">
                              <fo:inline color="blue"
                                         font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                         hyphenate="false">DmtEventListener</fo:inline>
                           </fo:basic-link> service can use service properties to filter
        the received events</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">In both cases events are delivered asynchronously and ordered per
    listener unless otherwise specified. Events to the DMT can occur because
    of modifications made in a session or they can occur because a Plugin
    changes its internal state and notifies the Dmt Admin service through the
    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.spi.MountPoint">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">MountPoint</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> interface.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Changes made through a session always start with a
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">SESSION_OPENED</fo:inline> event directly after the session is opened.
    This event must contain the properties defined in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i2939626">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">
                     <fo:inline font-style="italic">Life Cycle Event Properties</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2939626"/>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">If events originate from an atomic session then these events must be
    queued until the sessions is successfully committed, which can happen
    multiple times over the life time of a session. If the session is rolled
    back or runs into an error then none of the queued events must be
    sent.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">When a session is closed, which can happen automatically when the
    session fails, then the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">SESSION_CLOSED</fo:inline> event must be sent.
    This event must happen after any queued events. This closed event must
    contain the properties defined in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="i2939626">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">
                     <fo:inline font-style="italic">Life Cycle Event Properties</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="i2939626"/>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">An event must only be sent when that type of event actually
    occurred.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e3057">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.11.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Event Admin</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Event Admin, when present, must be used to deliver the Dmt Admin
      events asynchronously. The event types are specified in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dmt-event.types">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Table 117.7 on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dmt-event.types"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>, the Topic column defines the
      Event Admin topic. The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dmt-event.properties.lifecycle">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Table 117.10 on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dmt-event.properties.lifecycle"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dmt-event.properties.session">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Table 117.9 on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dmt-event.properties.session"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> define the Life Cycle and
      Session properties that must be passed as the event properties of Event
      Admin.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e3067">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.11.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Dmt Event Listeners</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">To receive the Dmt Admin events it is necessary to register a Dmt
      Event Listener service. It is possible to filter the events by
      registering a combination of the service properties defined in the
      following table.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions" start-indent="0pt">
                  <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="2em"
                            keep-together.within-column="auto"
                            id="d1184e3070">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               space-before.optimum="5pt"
                               space-before.minimum="5pt"
                               space-before.maximum="5pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               font-size="9pt"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                               space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                               space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-style="italic"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>Table 117.6</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>Service Properties for the Dmt Event Listener</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                     <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                               border-collapse="collapse"
                               table-layout="fixed"
                               width="100%">
                        <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="3" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="4" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                        <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                         keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                         font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Service Property</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Data Type</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Default</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-header>
                        <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEventListener.FILTER_EVENT">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">FILTER_EVENT</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">Integer</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">All Events</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">A bitmap of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">DmtEvent</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
              types: <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.SESSION_OPENED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">SESSION_OPENED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.ADDED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">ADDED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.COPIED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">COPIED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.DELETED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">DELETED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.RENAMED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">RENAMED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>, <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.REPLACED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">REPLACED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>, and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.SESSION_CLOSED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">SESSION_CLOSED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>. A Dmt Event's type must occur in the
              bitmap to be delivered.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEventListener.FILTER_PRINCIPAL">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">FILTER_PRINCIPAL</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">String+</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Any node</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Only deliver Dmt Events for which at least one of
              the given principals has the right to <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  font-size="9pt"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em">Get</fo:inline> that
              node.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEventListener.FILTER_SUBTREE">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">FILTER_SUBTREE</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">String+</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Any node</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">This property defines a number of sub-trees by
              specifying the URI of the top nodes of these sub-trees. Only
              events that occur in one of the sub-trees must be
              delivered.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-body>
                     </fo:table>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A Dmt Event must only be delivered to a Dmt Event Listener if the
      Bundle that registers the Dmt Event Listener service has the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.security.DmtPermission.GET">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">GET</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> Dmt Permission for each of the nodes used in the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">nodes</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">newNodes</fo:inline> properties as tested with
      the Bundle <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">hasPermission</fo:inline> method.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The Dmt Admin service must track Dmt Event Listener services and
      deliver matching events as long as a Dmt Event Listener service is
      registered. Any changes in the service properties must be expediently
      handled.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">A Dmt Event Listener must implement the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEventListener.changeOccurred-DmtEvent-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">changeOccurred(DmtEvent)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method. This method is called asynchronously
      from the actual event occurrence but each listener must receive the
      events in order.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Events are delivered with a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">DmtEvent</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> object.
      This object provides access to the properties of the event. Some
      properties are available as methods others must be retrieved through the
      <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.getProperty-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getProperty(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method. The methods that provide property
      information are listed in the property tables, see <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dmt-event.properties.lifecycle">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Table 117.10 on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dmt-event.properties.lifecycle"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e3155">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.11.3</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Atomic Sessions and Events</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The intent of the events is that a listener can follow the
      modifications to the DMT from the events alone. However, from an
      efficiency point of view certain events should be coalesced to minimize
      the number of events that a listener need to handle. For this reason,
      the Dmt Admin service must coalesce events if possible.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Two consecutive events can be coalesced when they are of the same
      type. In that case the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">nodes</fo:inline> and, if present, the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">newNodes</fo:inline> of the second event can be concatenated with the
      first event and the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">timestamp</fo:inline> must be derived from the
      first event. It is not necessary to remove duplicates from the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">nodes</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">newNodes</fo:inline>. This guarantees that the
      order of the nodes is in the order of the events.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e3171">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.11.4</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Event Types</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">This section describes the events that can be generated by the Dmt
      Admin service. <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dmt-event.types">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">Table 117.7</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> enumerates all
      the events and provides the name of the topic of Event Admin and the Dmt
      Event type for the listener model.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">There are two kinds of events:</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1184e3178">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e3179">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Life Cycle Events</fo:inline> - The events for
          session open and closed are the session events.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1184e3183">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Session Events</fo:inline> - <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">ADDED</fo:inline>,
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">DELETED</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">REPLACED</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">RENAMED</fo:inline>,
          and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">COPIED</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Session and life cycle events have different properties.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions" start-indent="0pt">
                  <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="2em"
                            keep-together.within-column="auto"
                            id="service.dmt-event.types">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               space-before.optimum="5pt"
                               space-before.minimum="5pt"
                               space-before.maximum="5pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               font-size="9pt"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                               space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                               space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-style="italic"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>Table 117.7</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>Event Types</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                     <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                               border-collapse="collapse"
                               table-layout="fixed"
                               width="100%">
                        <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="3" column-width="proportional-column-width(1.1)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="4" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                        <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                         keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                         font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Event</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Topic</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Dmt Event Type</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-header>
                        <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">SESSION OPENED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">org/osgi/service/dmt/DmtEvent/SESSION_OPENED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                       <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.SESSION_OPENED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">SESSION_OPENED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">A new session was opened. The event must the
              properties defined in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="service.dmt-event.properties.session">
                                          <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                     font-family="inherit"
                                                     letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                     hyphenate="inherit">Table 117.9 on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dmt-event.properties.session"/>
                                          </fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">ADDED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">org/osgi/service/dmt/DmtEvent/ADDED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                       <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.ADDED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">ADDED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">One or more nodes were added.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">DELETED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">org/osgi/service/dmt/DmtEvent/DELETED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                       <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.DELETED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">DELETED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">One or more existing nodes were
              deleted.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">REPLACED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">org/osgi/service/dmt/DmtEvent/REPLACED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                       <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.REPLACED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">REPLACED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Values of nodes were replaced.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">RENAMED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">org/osgi/service/dmt/DmtEvent/RENAMED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                       <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.RENAMED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">RENAMED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Existing nodes were renamed.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">COPIED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">org/osgi/service/dmt/DmtEvent/COPIED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                       <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.COPIED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">COPIED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Existing nodes were copied. A copy operation does
              not trigger an <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.ADDED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">ADDED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link> event (in addition to the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.COPIED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">COPIED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link> event), even though new node(s) are
              created. For efficiency reasons, recursive copy and delete
              operations must only generate a single <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.COPIED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">COPIED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link> and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.DELETED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">DELETED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link> event for the root of the affected
              sub-tree.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">SESSION CLOSED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">org/osgi/service/dmt/DmtEvent/SESSION_CLOSED</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                       <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.SESSION_CLOSED">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">SESSION_CLOSED</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">A session was closed either because it was closed
              explicitly or because there was an error detected. The event
              must the properties defined in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="service.dmt-event.properties.session">
                                          <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                     font-family="inherit"
                                                     letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                     hyphenate="inherit">Table 117.9 on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dmt-event.properties.session"/>
                                          </fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-body>
                     </fo:table>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d1184e3297">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.11.5</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>General Event Properties</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The following properties must be available as the event properties
      in Event Admin service and the properties in the Dmt Event for Dmt Event
      Listener services.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions" start-indent="0pt">
                  <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="2em"
                            keep-together.within-column="auto"
                            id="d1184e3300">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               space-before.optimum="5pt"
                               space-before.minimum="5pt"
                               space-before.maximum="5pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               font-size="9pt"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                               space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                               space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-style="italic"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>Table 117.8</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>General Event</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                     <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                               border-collapse="collapse"
                               table-layout="fixed"
                               width="100%">
                        <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(1.5)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="3" column-width="proportional-column-width(1.5)"/>
                        <fo:table-column column-number="4" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                        <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                         keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                         font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Property Name</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Type</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Dmt Event</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-header>
                        <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">event.topics</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block> </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Event topic, required by Event Admin but must also
              be present in the Dmt Events.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">session.id</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">Integer</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.getSessionId--">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">getSessionId()</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">A unique identifier for the session that triggered
              the event. This property has the same value as <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                      xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                      internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.getSessionId--">
                                          <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                     font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                     letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                     hyphenate="false">getSessionId()</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:basic-link> of the associated DMT session. If this
              event is generated outside a session then the session id must be
              -1, otherwise it must be &gt;=1.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">timestamp</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Long</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt"/>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">The time the event was started as defined by
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  font-size="9pt"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em">System.currentTimeMillis()</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                           </fo:table-row>
                           <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">bundle</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">Bundle</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt"/>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:table-cell>
                              <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                             padding-end="4pt"
                                             padding-top="1pt"
                                             padding-bottom="1pt">
                                 <fo:block>
                                    <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                              space-before.maximum="5pt">The initiating Bundle, this is the bundle that
              caused the event. This is either the Bundle that opened the
              associated session or the Plugin's bundle when there is no
              session (i.e. the session id is -1).</fo:block>
                                 </fo:block>
