                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">Alternatively, the Collection may contain Dmt Data objects but
        the collection must be homogeneous. The collection must always be a
        copy and changes made to the collection must not affect the
        DMT.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
