               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Since a Meta Node can contain multiple MIME types, there is no
      restrictions on the number of Protocol Adapters; a Plugin can specify
      the MIME types of multiple Protocol Adapters.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
