                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Gets the string representation of the {@code DmtData}. This method works
 for all formats.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 For string format data - including {@link #FORMAT_RAW_STRING} - the
 string value itself is returned, while for XML, date, time, integer,
 float, boolean, long and node formats the string form of the value is
 returned. Binary - including {@link #FORMAT_RAW_BINARY} - base64 data is
 represented by two-digit hexadecimal numbers for each byte separated by
 spaces. The {@link #NULL_VALUE} data has the string form of "
 {@code null}". Data of string or XML format containing the Java
 {@code null} value is represented by an empty string. DateTime data is
 formatted as {@code yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:SS'Z'}).</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the string representation of this {@code DmtData} instance</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.14.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>public abstract DmtEvent</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
Event class storing the details of a change in the tree. {@code DmtEvent} is
 used by {@code DmtAdmin} to notify registered {@link DmtEventListener EventListeners} services about important changes. Events are generated after
 every successful DMT change, and also when sessions are opened or closed. If
 a {@link DmtSession} is opened in atomic mode, DMT events are only sent when
 the session is committed, when the changes are actually performed.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The {@code type} of the event describes the change that triggered the event
 delivery. Each event carries the unique identifier of the session in which
 the described change happened or -1 when the change originated outside a
 session. The events describing changes in the DMT carry the list of affected
 nodes. In case of {@link #COPIED} or {@link #RENAMED} events, the event
 carries the list of new nodes as well.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.ADDED">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.6.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int ADDED = 1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
