                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.6.6</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int SESSION_CLOSED = 64</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Event type indicating that a session was closed. This type of event is
 sent when the session is closed by the client or becomes inactive for any
 other reason (session timeout, fatal errors in business methods, etc.).
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.SESSION_OPENED">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.6.7</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int SESSION_OPENED = 32</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Event type indicating that a new session was opened.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.getNewNodes--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.6.8</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract String[][] getNewNodes()</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
This method can be used to query the new nodes, when the type of the
 event is {@link #COPIED} or {@link #RENAMED}. For all other event types
 this method returns {@code null}.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The array returned by this method runs parallel to the array returned by
 {@link #getNodes()}, the elements in the two arrays contain the source
 and destination URIs for the renamed or copied nodes in the same order.
 All returned URIs are absolute.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This method returns only those nodes where the caller has the GET
 permission for the source or destination node of the operation.
 Therefore, it is possible that the method returns an empty array.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the array of newly created nodes</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtEvent.getNodes--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.6.9</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract String[][] getNodes()</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
This method can be used to query the subject nodes of this event. The
 method returns {@code null} for {@link #SESSION_OPENED} and
 {@link #SESSION_CLOSED}.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The method returns only those affected nodes that the caller has the GET
 permission for (or in case of {@link #COPIED} or {@link #RENAMED} events,
 where the caller has GET permissions for either the source or the
 destination nodes). Therefore, it is possible that the method returns an
 empty array. All returned URIs are absolute.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the array of affected nodes</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
