            <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>117.14.10</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>public abstract DmtSession</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
DmtSession provides concurrent access to the DMT. All DMT manipulation
 commands for management applications are available on the {@code DmtSession}
 interface. The session is associated with a root node which limits the
 subtree in which the operations can be executed within this session.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Most of the operations take a node URI as parameter, which can be either an
 absolute URI (starting with "./") or a URI relative to the root
 node of the session. The empty string as relative URI means the root URI the
 session was opened with. All segments of a URI must be within the segment
 length limit of the implementation, and the special characters '/' and '\'
 must be escaped (preceded by a '\').
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 See the {@link Uri#encode(String)} method for support on escaping invalid
 characters in a URI.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the URI specified does not correspond to a legitimate node in the tree an
 exception is thrown. The only exception is the {@link #isNodeUri(String)}
 method which returns {@code false} in case of an invalid URI.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Each method of {@code DmtSession} that accesses the tree in any way can throw
 {@code DmtIllegalStateException} if the session has been closed or
 invalidated (due to timeout, fatal exceptions, or unexpectedly unregistered
 plugins).</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.LOCK_TYPE_ATOMIC">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int LOCK_TYPE_ATOMIC = 2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
{@code LOCK_TYPE_ATOMIC} is an exclusive lock with transactional
 functionality. Commands of an atomic session will either fail or succeed
 together, if a single command fails then the whole session will be rolled
 back.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.LOCK_TYPE_EXCLUSIVE">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int LOCK_TYPE_EXCLUSIVE = 1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
{@code LOCK_TYPE_EXCLUSIVE} lock guarantees full access to the tree, but
 can not be shared with any other locks.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.LOCK_TYPE_SHARED">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.3</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int LOCK_TYPE_SHARED = 0</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Sessions created with {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock allows read-only
 access to the tree, but can be shared between multiple readers.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.STATE_CLOSED">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.4</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int STATE_CLOSED = 1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
The session is closed, DMT manipulation operations are not available,
 they throw {@code DmtIllegalStateException} if tried.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.STATE_INVALID">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.5</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int STATE_INVALID = 2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
The session is invalid because a fatal error happened. Fatal errors
 include the timeout of the session, any DmtException with the 'fatal'
 flag set, or the case when a plugin service is unregistered while in use
 by the session. DMT manipulation operations are not available, they throw
 {@code DmtIllegalStateException} if tried.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.STATE_OPEN">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.6</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final int STATE_OPEN = 0</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
The session is open, all session operations are available.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.close--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.7</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void close() throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Closes a session. If the session was opened with atomic lock mode, the
 {@code DmtSession} must first persist the changes made to the DMT by
 calling {@code commit()} on all (transactional) plugins participating in
 the session. See the documentation of the {@link #commit()} method for
 details and possible errors during this operation.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The state of the session changes to {@code DmtSession.STATE_CLOSED} if
 the close operation completed successfully, otherwise it becomes
 {@code DmtSession.STATE_INVALID}.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6149">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6150">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code METADATA_MISMATCH} in case of atomic sessions, if the
         commit operation failed because of meta-data restrictions</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6152">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code CONCURRENT_ACCESS} in case of atomic sessions, if the
         commit operation failed because of some modification outside the
         scope of the DMT to the nodes affected in the session</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6154">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} in case of atomic sessions, if an
         underlying plugin failed to commit</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6156">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6158">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if an underlying
         plugin failed to close, or if some unspecified error is
         encountered while attempting to complete the command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session is already closed or
         invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.commit--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.8</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void commit() throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Commits a series of DMT operations issued in the current atomic session
 since the last transaction boundary. Transaction boundaries are the
 creation of this object that starts the session, and all subsequent
 {@link #commit()} and {@link #rollback()} calls.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This method can fail even if all operations were successful. This can
 happen due to some multi-node semantic constraints defined by a specific
 implementation. For example, node A can be required to always have
 children A/B, A/C and A/D. If this condition is broken when
 {@code commit()} is executed, the method will fail, and throw a
 {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} exception.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 An error situation can arise due to the lack of a two phase commit
 mechanism in the underlying plugins. As an example, if plugin A has
 committed successfully but plugin B failed, the whole session must fail,
 but there is no way to undo the commit performed by A. To provide
 predictable behavior, the commit operation should continue with the
 remaining plugins even after detecting a failure. All exceptions received
 from failed commits are aggregated into one {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR}
 exception thrown by this method.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 In many cases the tree is not the only way to manage a given part of the
 system. It may happen that while modifying some nodes in an atomic
 session, the underlying settings are modified in parallel outside the
 scope of the DMT. If this is detected during commit, an exception with
 the code {@code CONCURRENT_ACCESS} is thrown.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6186">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6187">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the operation failed because of
         meta-data restrictions</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6189">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code CONCURRENT_ACCESS} if it is
         detected that some modification has been made outside the scope
         of the DMT to the nodes affected in the session's operations</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6191">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} if an error occurred during the
         commit of any of the underlying plugins</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6193">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6195">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code COMMAND_FAILED} if some
         unspecified error is encountered while attempting to complete the
         command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was not opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_ATOMIC} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.copy-String-String-boolean-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.9</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void copy(String nodeUri, String newNodeUri, boolean recursive) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the node or root of a subtree to be copied</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>newNodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the new node or root of a subtree</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>recursive</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>{@code false} if only a single node is copied,
        {@code true} if the whole subtree is copied</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Create a copy of a node or a whole subtree. Beside the structure and
 values of the nodes, most properties are also copied, with the exception
 of the ACL (Access Control List), Timestamp and Version properties.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The copy method is essentially a convenience method that could be
 substituted with a sequence of retrieval and update operations. This
 determines the permissions required for copying. However, some
 optimization can be possible if the source and target nodes are all
 handled by DmtAdmin or by the same plugin. In this case, the handler
 might be able to perform the underlying management operation more
 efficiently: for example, a configuration table can be copied at once
 instead of reading each node for each entry and creating it in the new
 tree.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This method may result in any of the errors possible for the contributing
 operations. Most of these are collected in the exception descriptions
 below, but for the full list also consult the documentation of
 {@link #getChildNodeNames(String)}, {@link #isLeafNode(String)},
 {@link #getNodeValue(String)}, {@link #getNodeType(String)},
 {@link #getNodeTitle(String)}, {@link #setNodeTitle(String, String)},
 {@link #createLeafNode(String, DmtData, String)} and
 {@link #createInteriorNode(String, String)}.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6231">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6232">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} or {@code newNodeUri}
         is {@code null} or syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6234">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code URI_TOO_LONG} if {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted
         by the {@code DmtAdmin} implementation (especially on systems
         with limited resources)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6236">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if
         {@code nodeUri} points to a non-existing node, or if
         {@code newNodeUri} points to a node that cannot exist in the tree
         according to the meta-data (see {@link #getMetaNode(String)})
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6238">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code NODE_ALREADY_EXISTS} if {@code newNodeUri} points
         to a node that already exists</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6240">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code PERMISSION_DENIED}
         if the session is associated with a principal and the ACL of the
         copied node(s) does not allow the {@code Get} operation, or the
         ACL of the parent of the target node does not allow the
         {@code Add} operation for the associated principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6242">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if {@code nodeUri} is an ancestor of
         {@code newNodeUri}, or if any of the implied retrieval or update
         operations are not allowed</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6244">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if
         any of the meta-data constraints of the implied retrieval or
         update operations are violated</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6246">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR}
         in an atomic session if the underlying plugin is read-only or
         does not support atomic writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6248">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6250">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code COMMAND_FAILED} if either URI is
         not within the current session's subtree, or if some unspecified
         error is encountered while attempting to complete the command
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the copied node(s) with the Get action
         present, or for the parent of the target node with the Add action</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createInteriorNode-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.10</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void createInteriorNode(String nodeUri) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node to create</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Create an interior node. If the parent node does not exist, it is created
 automatically, as if this method were called for the parent URI. This way
 all missing ancestor nodes leading to the specified node are created. Any
 exceptions encountered while creating the ancestors are propagated to the
 caller of this method, these are not explicitly listed in the error
 descriptions below.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If meta-data is available for the node, several checks are made before
 creating it. The node must have {@code MetaNode.CMD_ADD} access type, it
 must be defined as a non-permanent interior node, the node name must
 conform to the valid names, and the creation of the new node must not
 cause the maximum occurrence number to be exceeded.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the meta-data cannot be retrieved because the given node cannot
 possibly exist in the tree (it is not defined in the specification), the
 {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} error code is returned (see
 {@link #getMetaNode(String)}).</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6280">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6281">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6283">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6285">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         node that cannot exist in the tree (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6287">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code NODE_ALREADY_EXISTS} if {@code nodeUri} points to a node
         that already exists</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6289">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the
         session is associated with a principal and the ACL of the parent
         node does not allow the {@code Add} operation for the associated
         principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6291">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the parent node
         is not an interior node, or in non-atomic sessions if the
         underlying plugin is read-only or does not support non-atomic
         writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6293">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node could not
         be created because of meta-data restrictions (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6295">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} in an atomic session if the underlying
         plugin is read-only or does not support atomic writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6297">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6299">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, or if some unspecified
         error is encountered while attempting to complete the command
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the parent node with the Add action
         present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createInteriorNode-String-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.11</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void createInteriorNode(String nodeUri, String type) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node to create</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>type</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the type URI of the interior node, can be {@code null} if no
        node type is defined</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Create an interior node with a given type. The type of interior node, if
 specified, is a URI identifying a DDF document. If the parent node does
 not exist, it is created automatically, as if
 {@link #createInteriorNode(String)} were called for the parent URI. This
 way all missing ancestor nodes leading to the specified node are created.
 Any exceptions encountered while creating the ancestors are propagated to
 the caller of this method, these are not explicitly listed in the error
 descriptions below.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If meta-data is available for the node, several checks are made before
 creating it. The node must have {@code MetaNode.CMD_ADD} access type, it
 must be defined as a non-permanent interior node, the node name must
 conform to the valid names, and the creation of the new node must not
 cause the maximum occurrence number to be exceeded.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the meta-data cannot be retrieved because the given node cannot
 possibly exist in the tree (it is not defined in the specification), the
 {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} error code is returned (see
 {@link #getMetaNode(String)}).
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Interior node type identifiers must follow the format defined in section
 7.7.7.2 of the OMA Device Management Tree and Description document.
 Checking the validity of the type string does not have to be done by the
 DmtAdmin, this can be left to the plugin handling the node (if any), to
 avoid unnecessary double-checks.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6333">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6334">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6336">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6338">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         node that cannot exist in the tree (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6340">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code NODE_ALREADY_EXISTS} if {@code nodeUri} points to a node
         that already exists</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6342">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the
         session is associated with a principal and the ACL of the parent
         node does not allow the {@code Add} operation for the associated
         principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6344">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the parent node
         is not an interior node, or in non-atomic sessions if the
         underlying plugin is read-only or does not support non-atomic
         writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6346">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node could not
         be created because of meta-data restrictions (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6348">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} in an atomic session if the underlying
         plugin is read-only or does not support atomic writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6350">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6352">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, if the type string is
         invalid (see above), or if some unspecified error is encountered
         while attempting to complete the command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the parent node with the Add action
         present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>See Also</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">createInteriorNode(String)</fo:inline>, <fo:basic-link external-destination="url(http://member.openmobilealliance.org/ftp/public_documents/dm/Permanent_documents/OMA-TS-DM-TND-V1_2-20050615-C.zip)">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
      OMA Device Management Tree and Description v1.2 draft</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>
                                 <fo:inline hyphenate="false"> [<fo:basic-link external-destination="url(http://member.openmobilealliance.org/ftp/public_documents/dm/Permanent_documents/OMA-TS-DM-TND-V1_2-20050615-C.zip)">http://member.openmobilealliance.org/ftp/public_documents/dm/Permanent_documents/OMA-TS-DM-TND-V1_2-20050615-C.zip</fo:basic-link>]</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createLeafNode-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.12</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void createLeafNode(String nodeUri) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node to create</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Create a leaf node with default value and MIME type. If a node does not
 have a default value or MIME type, this method will throw a
 {@code DmtException} with error code {@code METADATA_MISMATCH}. Note that
 a node might have a default value or MIME type even if there is no
 meta-data for the node or its meta-data does not specify the default.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the parent node does not exist, it is created automatically, as if
 {@link #createInteriorNode(String)} were called for the parent URI. This
 way all missing ancestor nodes leading to the specified node are created.
 Any exceptions encountered while creating the ancestors are propagated to
 the caller of this method, these are not explicitly listed in the error
 descriptions below.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If meta-data is available for a node, several checks are made before
 creating it. The node must have {@code MetaNode.CMD_ADD} access type, it
 must be defined as a non-permanent leaf node, the node name must conform
 to the valid names, and the creation of the new node must not cause the
 maximum occurrence number to be exceeded.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the meta-data cannot be retrieved because the given node cannot
 possibly exist in the tree (it is not defined in the specification), the
 {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} error code is returned (see
 {@link #getMetaNode(String)}).</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6393">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6394">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6396">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6398">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         node that cannot exist in the tree (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6400">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code NODE_ALREADY_EXISTS} if {@code nodeUri} points to a node
         that already exists</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6402">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the
         session is associated with a principal and the ACL of the parent
         node does not allow the {@code Add} operation for the associated
         principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6404">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the parent node
         is not an interior node, or in non-atomic sessions if the
         underlying plugin is read-only or does not support non-atomic
         writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6406">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node could not
         be created because of meta-data restrictions (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6408">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} in an atomic session if the underlying
         plugin is read-only or does not support atomic writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6410">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6412">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, or if some unspecified
         error is encountered while attempting to complete the command
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the parent node with the Add action
         present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>See Also</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">createLeafNode(String, DmtData)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createLeafNode-String-DmtData-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.13</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void createLeafNode(String nodeUri, DmtData value) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node to create</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>value</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the value to be given to the new node, can be {@code null}</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Create a leaf node with a given value and the default MIME type. If the
 specified value is {@code null}, the default value is taken. If the node
 does not have a default MIME type or value (if needed), this method will
 throw a {@code DmtException} with error code {@code METADATA_MISMATCH}.
 Note that a node might have a default value or MIME type even if there is
 no meta-data for the node or its meta-data does not specify the default.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the parent node does not exist, it is created automatically, as if
 {@link #createInteriorNode(String)} were called for the parent URI. This
 way all missing ancestor nodes leading to the specified node are created.
 Any exceptions encountered while creating the ancestors are propagated to
 the caller of this method, these are not explicitly listed in the error
 descriptions below.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If meta-data is available for a node, several checks are made before
 creating it. The node must have {@code MetaNode.CMD_ADD} access type, it
 must be defined as a non-permanent leaf node, the node name must conform
 to the valid names, the node value must conform to the value constraints,
 and the creation of the new node must not cause the maximum occurrence
 number to be exceeded.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the meta-data cannot be retrieved because the given node cannot
 possibly exist in the tree (it is not defined in the specification), the
 {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} error code is returned (see
 {@link #getMetaNode(String)}).
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Nodes of {@code null} format can be created by using
 {@link DmtData#NULL_VALUE} as second argument.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6454">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6455">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6457">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6459">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         node that cannot exist in the tree (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6461">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code NODE_ALREADY_EXISTS} if {@code nodeUri} points to a node
         that already exists</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6463">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the
         session is associated with a principal and the ACL of the parent
         node does not allow the {@code Add} operation for the associated
         principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6465">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the parent node
         is not an interior node, or in non-atomic sessions if the
         underlying plugin is read-only or does not support non-atomic
         writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6467">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node could not
         be created because of meta-data restrictions (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6469">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} in an atomic session if the underlying
         plugin is read-only or does not support atomic writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6471">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6473">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, or if some unspecified
         error is encountered while attempting to complete the command
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the parent node with the Add action
         present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.createLeafNode-String-DmtData-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.14</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void createLeafNode(String nodeUri, DmtData value, String mimeType) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node to create</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>value</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the value to be given to the new node, can be {@code null}</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>mimeType</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the MIME type to be given to the new node, can be
        {@code null}</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Create a leaf node with a given value and MIME type. If the specified
 value or MIME type is {@code null}, their default values are taken. If
 the node does not have the necessary defaults, this method will throw a
 {@code DmtException} with error code {@code METADATA_MISMATCH}. Note that
 a node might have a default value or MIME type even if there is no
 meta-data for the node or its meta-data does not specify the default.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the parent node does not exist, it is created automatically, as if
 {@link #createInteriorNode(String)} were called for the parent URI. This
 way all missing ancestor nodes leading to the specified node are created.
 Any exceptions encountered while creating the ancestors are propagated to
 the caller of this method, these are not explicitly listed in the error
 descriptions below.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If meta-data is available for a node, several checks are made before
 creating it. The node must have {@code MetaNode.CMD_ADD} access type, it
 must be defined as a non-permanent leaf node, the node name must conform
 to the valid names, the node value must conform to the value constraints,
 the MIME type must be among the listed types, and the creation of the new
 node must not cause the maximum occurrence number to be exceeded.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If the meta-data cannot be retrieved because the given node cannot
 possibly exist in the tree (it is not defined in the specification), the
 {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} error code is returned (see
 {@link #getMetaNode(String)}).
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Nodes of {@code null} format can be created by using
 {@link DmtData#NULL_VALUE} as second argument.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The MIME type string must conform to the definition in RFC 2045. Checking
 its validity does not have to be done by the DmtAdmin, this can be left
 to the plugin handling the node (if any), to avoid unnecessary
 double-checks.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6512">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6513">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6515">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6517">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         node that cannot exist in the tree (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6519">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code NODE_ALREADY_EXISTS} if {@code nodeUri} points to a node
         that already exists</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6521">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the
         session is associated with a principal and the ACL of the parent
         node does not allow the {@code Add} operation for the associated
         principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6523">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the parent node
         is not an interior node, or in non-atomic sessions if the
         underlying plugin is read-only or does not support non-atomic
         writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6525">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node could not
         be created because of meta-data restrictions (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6527">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} in an atomic session if the underlying
         plugin is read-only or does not support atomic writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6529">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6531">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, if {@code mimeType} is not
         a proper MIME type string (see above), or if some unspecified
         error is encountered while attempting to complete the command
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the parent node with the Add action
         present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>See Also</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">createLeafNode(String, DmtData)</fo:inline>, <fo:basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2045.txt)">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">RFC 2045</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>
                                 <fo:inline hyphenate="false"> [<fo:basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2045.txt)">http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2045.txt</fo:basic-link>]</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.deleteNode-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.15</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void deleteNode(String nodeUri) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Delete the given node. Deleting interior nodes is recursive, the whole
 subtree under the given node is deleted. It is not allowed to delete the
 root node of the session.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If meta-data is available for a node, several checks are made before
 deleting it. The node must be non-permanent, it must have the
 {@code MetaNode.CMD_DELETE} access type, and if zero occurrences of the
 node are not allowed, it must not be the last one.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6571">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6572">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6574">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6576">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         non-existing node</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6578">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the
         session is associated with a principal and the ACL of the node
         does not allow the {@code Delete} operation for the associated
         principal </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6580">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the target node
         is the root of the session, or in non-atomic sessions if the
         underlying plugin is read-only or does not support non-atomic
         writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6582">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node could not
         be deleted because of meta-data restrictions (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6584">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code TRANSACTION_ERROR} in an atomic session if the underlying
         plugin is read-only or does not support atomic writing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6586">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6588">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, or if some unspecified
         error is encountered while attempting to complete the command
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the node with the Delete action present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.execute-String-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.16</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void execute(String nodeUri, String data) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the node on which the execute operation is issued</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>data</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the parameter of the execute operation, can be {@code null}</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Executes a node. This corresponds to the EXEC operation in OMA DM. This
 method cannot be called in a read-only session.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The semantics of an execute operation and the data parameter it takes
 depends on the definition of the managed object on which the command is
 issued.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6620">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6621">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6623">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6625">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if the node does not exist</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6627">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the session is associated with
         a principal and the ACL of the node does not allow the
         {@code Execute} operation for the associated principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6629">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the specified node is a scaffold node</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6631">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node cannot be executed
         according to the meta-data (does not have
         {@code MetaNode.CMD_EXECUTE} access type)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6633">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6635">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, if no DmtExecPlugin is
         associated with the node and the DmtAdmin can not execute the
         node, or if some unspecified error is encountered while
         attempting to complete the command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the node with the Exec action present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>See Also</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">execute(String, String, String)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.execute-String-String-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.17</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void execute(String nodeUri, String correlator, String data) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the node on which the execute operation is issued</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>correlator</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>an identifier to associate this operation with any
        notifications sent in response to it, can be {@code null} if not
        needed</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>data</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the parameter of the execute operation, can be {@code null}</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Executes a node, also specifying a correlation ID for use in response
 notifications. This operation corresponds to the EXEC command in OMA DM.
 This method cannot be called in a read-only session.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The semantics of an execute operation and the data parameter it takes
 depends on the definition of the managed object on which the command is
 issued. If a correlation ID is specified, it should be used as the
 {@code correlator} parameter for notifications sent in response to this
 execute operation.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6678">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6679">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6681">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6683">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if the node does not exist</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6685">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the session is associated with a
         principal and the ACL of the node does not allow the
         {@code Execute} operation for the associated principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6687">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the specified node is a scaffold node</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6689">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if the node cannot be executed
         according to the meta-data (does not have
         {@code MetaNode.CMD_EXECUTE} access type)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6691">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6693">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, if no DmtExecPlugin is
         associated with the node, or if some unspecified error is
         encountered while attempting to complete the command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session was opened using the
         {@code LOCK_TYPE_SHARED} lock type, or if the session is already
         closed or invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the node with the Exec action present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>See Also</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">execute(String, String)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getChildNodeNames-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.18</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract String[][] getChildNodeNames(String nodeUri) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Get the list of children names of a node. The returned array contains the
 names - not the URIs - of the immediate children nodes of the given node.
 The elements are in no particular order. The returned array must not
 contain {@code null} entries.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the list of child node names as a string array or an empty string
         array if the node has no children</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6731">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6732">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6734">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if {@code nodeUri} is longer than
         accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin} implementation (especially on
         systems with limited resources)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6736">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         non-existing node</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6738">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the session is associated with a
         principal and the ACL of the node does not allow the {@code Get}
         operation for the associated principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6740">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_NOT_ALLOWED} if the specified node is not an
         interior node</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6742">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if node information cannot be
         retrieved according to the meta-data (it does not have
         {@code MetaNode.CMD_GET} access type)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6744">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while
         accessing the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6746">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not within the current
         session's subtree, or if some unspecified error is encountered
         while attempting to complete the command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session is already closed or
         invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the node with the Get action present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getEffectiveNodeAcl-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.19</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract Acl getEffectiveNodeAcl(String nodeUri) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Gives the Access Control List in effect for a given node. The returned
 {@code Acl} takes inheritance into account, that is if there is no ACL
 defined for the node, it will be derived from the closest ancestor having
 an ACL defined.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the Access Control List belonging to the node</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6777">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6778">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6780">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if {@code nodeUri} is longer than
         accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin} implementation (especially on
         systems with limited resources)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6782">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         non-existing node</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6784">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the session is associated with a
         principal and the ACL of the node does not allow the {@code Get}
         operation for the associated principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6786">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if node information cannot be
         retrieved according to the meta-data (the node does not have
         {@code MetaNode.CMD_GET} access type)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6788">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while
         accessing the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6790">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not within the current
         session's subtree, or if some unspecified error is encountered
         while attempting to complete the command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session is already closed or
         invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– in case of local sessions, if the caller does
         not have {@code DmtPermission} for the node with the Get action
         present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>See Also</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">getNodeAcl(String)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getLockType--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.20</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract int getLockType()</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Gives the type of lock the session has.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the lock type of the session, one of {@link #LOCK_TYPE_SHARED},
         {@link #LOCK_TYPE_EXCLUSIVE} and {@link #LOCK_TYPE_ATOMIC}</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getMetaNode-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.21</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract MetaNode getMetaNode(String nodeUri) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Get the meta data which describes a given node. Meta data can only be
 inspected, it can not be changed.
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The {@code MetaNode} object returned to the client is the combination of
 the meta data returned by the data plugin (if any) plus the meta data
 returned by the DmtAdmin. If there are differences in the meta data
 elements known by the plugin and the DmtAdmin then the plugin specific
 elements take precedence.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Note, that a node does not have to exist for having meta-data associated
 with it. This method may provide meta-data for any node that can possibly
 exist in the tree (any node defined in the specification). For nodes that
 are not defined, it may throw {@code DmtException} with the error code
 {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND}. To allow easier implementation of plugins that do
 not provide meta-data, it is allowed to return {@code null} for any node,
 regardless of whether it is defined or not.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>a MetaNode which describes meta data information, can be
         {@code null} if there is no meta data available for the given
         node</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6837">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6838">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6840">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if
         {@code nodeUri} is longer than accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin}
         implementation (especially on systems with limited resources)
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6842">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block> {@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         node that is not defined in the tree (see above)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6844">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the session is associated with a
         principal and the ACL of the node does not allow the {@code Get}
         operation for the associated principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6846">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>
         {@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while accessing
         the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6848">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not
         within the current session's subtree, or if some unspecified
         error is encountered while attempting to complete the command
         </fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtIllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the session is already closed or
         invalidated</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic"/>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation, or,
         in case of local sessions, if the caller does not have
         {@code DmtPermission} for the node with the Get action present</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dmt.DmtSession.getNodeAcl-String-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>117.14.10.22</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract Acl getNodeAcl(String nodeUri) throws DmtException</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>nodeUri</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the URI of the node</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Get the Access Control List associated with a given node. The returned
 {@code Acl} object does not take inheritance into account, it gives the
 ACL specifically given to the node.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>the Access Control List belonging to the node or {@code null} if
         none defined</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">DmtException</fo:inline>– with the following possible error codes:
         <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                                space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                                space-after.optimum="1em"
                                                space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                                space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d1184e6879">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6880">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code INVALID_URI} if {@code nodeUri} is {@code null} or
         syntactically invalid</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6882">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code URI_TOO_LONG} if {@code nodeUri} is longer than
         accepted by the {@code DmtAdmin} implementation (especially on
         systems with limited resources)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6884">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code NODE_NOT_FOUND} if {@code nodeUri} points to a
         non-existing node</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6886">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code PERMISSION_DENIED} if the session is associated with a
         principal and the ACL of the node does not allow the {@code Get}
         operation for the associated principal</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6888">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code METADATA_MISMATCH} if node information cannot be
         retrieved according to the meta-data (the node does not have
         {@code MetaNode.CMD_GET} access type)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6890">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code DATA_STORE_FAILURE} if an error occurred while
         accessing the data store</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d1184e6892">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>{@code COMMAND_FAILED} if the URI is not within the current
         session's subtree, or if some unspecified error is encountered
         while attempting to complete the command</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
