                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SecurityException</fo:inline>– if the caller does not have the necessary
         permissions to execute the underlying management operation</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
