                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Creates a new {@code AlertPermission} object with its name set to the
 target string. Name must be non-null and non-empty.
   </fo:block>
